# The table editor on a new table (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900: the plunger lane, the table's axis, a flipper and
# its mirror image.
# The plunger lane: the wall, the gate and the plunger at once.
4 key g meta
5 text +plunger-lane
6 key Enter
# The axis of the table is in the middle of the board; its marker on the ruler is dragged to the middle of what the lane leaves.
9 move 669 118
10 down
11 move 663 118
12 move 658 118
13 up
# A left flipper, then its mirror image: a right flipper, which rests and swings the other way under the other button.
16 key g meta
17 text +left-flipper
18 key Enter
20 move 597 743
21 down
22 up
24 key m
# Save.
27 key s meta
